WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.447 --> 00:00:03.981
white house will have questions

00:00:04.248 --> 00:00:04.548
for days on this.

00:00:05.116 --> 00:00:06.117
Thank you very much.

00:00:06.383 --> 00:00:07.151
Appreciate that.

00:00:07.418 --> 00:00:09.120
Let's discuss now a CNN

00:00:09.320 --> 00:00:10.054
national security analyst and

00:00:10.321 --> 00:00:11.255
former director of national

00:00:11.522 --> 00:00:14.091
intelligence, James clapper.

00:00:15.126 --> 00:00:15.559
Director, thank you for being

00:00:15.826 --> 00:00:16.227
with us.

00:00:16.494 --> 00:00:17.361
We appreciate it.

00:00:17.795 --> 00:00:20.197
Just your reaction to the

00:00:20.464 --> 00:00:22.266
decision to wait to shoot this

00:00:22.533 --> 00:00:24.268
balloon down after a reach the

00:00:25.169 --> 00:00:27.204
atlantic as opposed to earlier

00:00:27.471 --> 00:00:27.671
in the week.

00:00:27.938 --> 00:00:28.439
What is your sense of how this

00:00:28.706 --> 00:00:29.140
went down?

00:00:29.140 --> 00:00:32.510
&gt;&gt; I think it was the right

00:00:32.776 --> 00:00:35.179
thing to do, I think there is a

00:00:35.446 --> 00:00:37.348
balance drawn here by affirming

00:00:37.615 --> 00:00:40.151
our sovereignty and at the same

00:00:41.185 --> 00:00:43.154
time, protecting its safety of

00:00:43.420 --> 00:00:44.255
people below.

00:00:45.156 --> 00:00:46.357
I can imagine the reaction if

00:00:46.624 --> 00:00:49.293
the thing had blown up and been

00:00:49.560 --> 00:00:51.295
shot down over a red state and

00:00:52.129 --> 00:00:53.831
somebody got killed or heard or

00:00:54.098 --> 00:00:55.466
there was property damage and

00:00:56.367 --> 00:00:58.335
the outrage that would result

00:00:59.370 --> 00:00:59.537
from not.

00:01:00.171 --> 00:01:01.272
This was the best of both

00:01:02.006 --> 00:01:02.239
worlds for me.

00:01:03.307 --> 00:01:04.508
As I understand, it it was

00:01:05.176 --> 00:01:06.143
within our territorial waters

00:01:06.410 --> 00:01:09.180
and obviously, no jeopardy to

00:01:09.446 --> 00:01:09.813
anyone on the ground.

00:01:10.080 --> 00:01:11.182
So, to me it was the right

00:01:11.182 --> 00:01:14.051
thing to do I think.

00:01:14.785 --> 00:01:17.188
This will afford us some

00:01:17.221 --> 00:01:17.688
diplomatic leverage with the

00:01:17.955 --> 00:01:18.088
Chinese.

00:01:18.355 --> 00:01:21.192
&gt;&gt; That leads me to my next

00:01:21.392 --> 00:01:22.760
question, what do you think the

00:01:23.194 --> 00:01:23.360
Chinese were up to?

00:01:23.727 --> 00:01:26.030
Obviously, they had to assume

00:01:26.297 --> 00:01:27.198
we were going to see this thing

00:01:27.464 --> 00:01:27.865
in the sky.

00:01:28.132 --> 00:01:29.200
And this was going to be

00:01:29.767 --> 00:01:29.934
detected.

00:01:30.201 --> 00:01:30.834
Does that tell us a little bit

00:01:31.202 --> 00:01:31.569
about what their motivations

00:01:31.835 --> 00:01:32.102
might have been?

00:01:32.369 --> 00:01:33.804
&gt;&gt; No.

00:01:35.706 --> 00:01:37.975
To me, this is a mystery.

00:01:38.242 --> 00:01:40.744
The why exactly they did this

00:01:41.212 --> 00:01:41.779
--

00:01:41.779 --> 00:01:43.948
that is why I have a tendency

00:01:44.215 --> 00:01:47.651
to accept the explanation that

00:01:47.918 --> 00:01:49.820
this was something that went

00:01:50.087 --> 00:01:50.221
astray.

00:01:50.654 --> 00:01:53.691
I don't buy what they are

00:01:53.958 --> 00:01:54.191
saying was --

00:01:54.625 --> 00:01:56.827
that is why this will be very

00:01:57.228 --> 00:01:58.696
good to recover the payload

00:01:59.230 --> 00:02:01.232
from the balloon and understand

00:02:01.799 --> 00:02:03.767
what kinds of sensors it had on.

00:02:04.034 --> 00:02:06.637
As others have discussed, the

00:02:06.904 --> 00:02:08.806
Chinese have very good overhead

00:02:09.773 --> 00:02:10.207
satellite systems that can

00:02:10.474 --> 00:02:13.244
collect all kinds of imagery

00:02:13.244 --> 00:02:13.677
intelligence.

00:02:13.944 --> 00:02:16.680
Probably better than with a

00:02:17.248 --> 00:02:17.348
balloon.

00:02:17.348 --> 00:02:18.749
The issue for me is what other

00:02:19.683 --> 00:02:21.885
kinds of sensors or phenomenon

00:02:22.152 --> 00:02:24.788
olive tree that this balloon

00:02:25.256 --> 00:02:25.923
was trying to collect and

00:02:26.190 --> 00:02:28.659
hopefully we will learn that by

00:02:28.926 --> 00:02:29.827
exploiting the payload.

00:02:30.094 --> 00:02:32.029
&gt;&gt; The balloon might not have

00:02:32.630 --> 00:02:33.697
been just taking pictures, is

00:02:33.964 --> 00:02:34.164
that right?

00:02:34.431 --> 00:02:37.735
&gt;&gt; Exactly, if it was just

00:02:38.002 --> 00:02:39.270
taking pictures, and I really

00:02:39.670 --> 00:02:41.639
don't understand that.

00:02:41.905 --> 00:02:43.807
Because as I say, the Chinese

00:02:44.708 --> 00:02:45.676
overhead satellites can do

00:02:45.943 --> 00:02:46.877
every bit what that balloon

00:02:47.278 --> 00:02:47.911
could do and more.

00:02:48.646 --> 00:02:50.714
Now, if it was somehow

00:02:51.715 --> 00:02:53.651
intercepting radiation,

00:02:54.018 --> 00:02:54.752
non-literal communications,

00:02:55.653 --> 00:02:56.754
literal communications, I don't

00:02:57.288 --> 00:02:57.855
know.

00:02:57.855 --> 00:02:58.188
We will learn that.

00:02:58.689 --> 00:03:00.791
But it just seems to me strange

00:03:01.792 --> 00:03:02.626
that the Chinese would

00:03:02.893 --> 00:03:03.794
intentionally do this,

00:03:04.795 --> 00:03:05.896
particularly at this particular

00:03:06.163 --> 00:03:06.730
time.

00:03:07.931 --> 00:03:09.700
&gt;&gt; The balloon we are told will

00:03:09.967 --> 00:03:10.334
be analyzed once it is

00:03:10.601 --> 00:03:12.836
retrieved at an FBI lab in

00:03:13.771 --> 00:03:13.937
quantico.

00:03:14.204 --> 00:03:16.907
How critical is it at this

00:03:17.308 --> 00:03:17.875
point for Navy divers, assets

00:03:18.142 --> 00:03:19.643
there in atlantic right now,

00:03:19.910 --> 00:03:21.912
retrieving this, how critical

00:03:22.179 --> 00:03:22.746
is it for them to get that

00:03:23.314 --> 00:03:23.547
piece of equipment out of the

00:03:23.814 --> 00:03:23.914
water?

00:03:24.181 --> 00:03:29.720
&gt;&gt; Pretty critical, because it

00:03:29.987 --> 00:03:33.857
was designed to survive in a

00:03:34.124 --> 00:03:35.859
wet environment and that is not

00:03:36.727 --> 00:03:37.328
the environment it was

00:03:37.361 --> 00:03:37.795
operating in.

00:03:38.629 --> 00:03:41.332
So, the quicker the divers can

00:03:41.365 --> 00:03:44.034
get to it and retreat, it be

00:03:44.301 --> 00:03:44.435
better.

00:03:44.702 --> 00:03:45.769
Again, I don't know the depth

00:03:46.036 --> 00:03:48.839
of the water where it actually

00:03:49.340 --> 00:03:49.873
fell.

00:03:49.873 --> 00:03:50.941
That will be another challenge,

00:03:51.342 --> 00:03:53.844
depending on how deep the water

00:03:54.111 --> 00:03:54.878
is, about the quicker the

00:03:55.346 --> 00:03:55.646
better.

00:03:55.646 --> 00:03:57.748
&gt;&gt; You were director of

00:03:58.015 --> 00:03:58.816
national intelligence, maybe

00:03:59.350 --> 00:03:59.950
you can answer this question?

00:04:00.651 --> 00:04:00.918
Is this unusual?

00:04:01.685 --> 00:04:02.786
Do you have spy balloons flying

00:04:03.354 --> 00:04:04.121
over the continental united

00:04:04.388 --> 00:04:04.521
States?

00:04:04.788 --> 00:04:09.593
&gt;&gt; Yes, I don't recall an

00:04:09.860 --> 00:04:12.429
instance of it during my time

00:04:12.696 --> 00:04:13.530
as being --

00:04:14.365 --> 00:04:15.733
for six and a half years.

00:04:16.333 --> 00:04:17.735
I don't recollect this.

00:04:18.001 --> 00:04:20.304
I will tell you, I've had some

00:04:20.571 --> 00:04:21.505
personal experience with using

00:04:21.772 --> 00:04:23.374
balloons as intelligence

00:04:23.574 --> 00:04:24.608
collectors, particularly for

00:04:25.576 --> 00:04:26.343
imagery, and they're not very

00:04:27.444 --> 00:04:27.911
efficient for that purpose.

00:04:28.379 --> 00:04:29.413
That is why I am a little bit

00:04:30.013 --> 00:04:30.547
skeptical of imagery.

00:04:32.316 --> 00:04:36.387
And they are so subject to the

00:04:36.653 --> 00:04:37.554
vagaries of weather.

00:04:37.821 --> 00:04:40.324
Missed, fog, rain.

00:04:40.591 --> 00:04:41.392
And especially as we've seen in

00:04:41.625 --> 00:04:43.394
this case, wind.

00:04:43.594 --> 00:04:45.396
They are hard to control.

00:04:45.662 --> 00:04:48.499
I am very interested to learn,

00:04:48.766 --> 00:04:50.367
if we can, publicly, just what

00:04:50.634 --> 00:04:52.436
sort of sensor sweep was in the

00:04:53.404 --> 00:04:54.438
payload of the balloon.

00:04:54.705 --> 00:04:57.408
&gt;&gt; And do we have the technical

00:04:57.608 --> 00:04:59.476
capabilities do you think to

00:04:59.743 --> 00:05:00.611
already know what this balloon

00:05:00.878 --> 00:05:02.379
was doing, what the

00:05:02.646 --> 00:05:04.381
surveillance equipment was

00:05:04.648 --> 00:05:04.748
doing.

00:05:05.015 --> 00:05:05.482
Could they have gotten an up

00:05:05.749 --> 00:05:06.550
close look of it before it was

00:05:06.817 --> 00:05:07.418
shot down to know exactly what

00:05:07.584 --> 00:05:07.818
this thing is?

00:05:08.285 --> 00:05:13.457
&gt;&gt; I will just say that that is

00:05:13.724 --> 00:05:15.526
possible, I don't know, either

00:05:16.527 --> 00:05:18.462
through direct observation or

00:05:18.729 --> 00:05:21.465
indirect collection from some

00:05:21.732 --> 00:05:21.965
other source.

00:05:22.433 --> 00:05:24.802
So, it's possible, but I'm just

00:05:25.068 --> 00:05:25.436
speculating here.

00:05:25.636 --> 00:05:26.537
&gt;&gt; Yeah.

00:05:26.804 --> 00:05:28.539
One of the interesting things

00:05:28.806 --> 00:05:29.740
that Oren Liebermann was

00:05:30.007 --> 00:05:31.508
reporting earlier this

00:05:31.775 --> 00:05:32.409
afternoon is that the U.S. Says

00:05:32.676 --> 00:05:34.511
it was able to prevent the

00:05:35.479 --> 00:05:35.813
balloon from gaining

00:05:36.413 --> 00:05:36.647
intelligence.

00:05:36.914 --> 00:05:37.614
That they could do some

00:05:37.881 --> 00:05:38.215
mitigation efforts.

00:05:38.482 --> 00:05:40.350
It sounded as though they were

00:05:40.617 --> 00:05:41.051
talking about jamming the

00:05:41.819 --> 00:05:42.219
balloon to some extent.

00:05:43.787 --> 00:05:44.288
What do you think about that?

00:05:45.055 --> 00:05:48.892
&gt;&gt; One thing I wondered about

00:05:49.460 --> 00:05:50.627
is if it had some sort of

00:05:53.931 --> 00:05:54.298
communication relaces.

00:05:54.565 --> 00:05:57.100
Either through satellites or

00:05:57.468 --> 00:06:00.204
some other terrestrial --

00:06:01.472 --> 00:06:04.241
that we somehow got access to.

00:06:05.476 --> 00:06:06.143
I don't know.

00:06:06.143 --> 00:06:07.478
If that were the case, well

00:06:09.480 --> 00:06:09.947
certainly, they could jam that

00:06:10.214 --> 00:06:10.747
and prevent the transmission.

00:06:13.484 --> 00:06:15.486
Either guidance to the balloon,

00:06:16.253 --> 00:06:19.490
if it had that, or from sensor

00:06:20.357 --> 00:06:23.494
or sensors on the balloon and

00:06:23.527 --> 00:06:23.894
interfere with that --

00:06:24.294 --> 00:06:24.695
it is quite conceivable.

00:06:25.729 --> 00:06:30.133
&gt;&gt; One of the questions I think

00:06:30.400 --> 00:06:31.502
that is floating around that is

00:06:31.602 --> 00:06:33.504
highly intriguing as what does

00:06:33.504 --> 00:06:34.037
this say about Chinese

00:06:35.105 --> 00:06:37.040
espionage efforts in the united

00:06:37.508 --> 00:06:37.708
States?

00:06:37.708 --> 00:06:38.275
It looks like they were doing

00:06:38.542 --> 00:06:40.143
some over the United States.

00:06:40.410 --> 00:06:40.844
But what does it say about

00:06:41.178 --> 00:06:42.079
Chinese espionage efforts

00:06:42.346 --> 00:06:43.080
inside the United States and

00:06:44.181 --> 00:06:45.115
how extensive they are?

00:06:45.516 --> 00:06:48.018
Because I imagine the American

00:06:48.285 --> 00:06:49.186
people might surmise that it's

00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:49.920
going on and it's expensive.

00:06:50.187 --> 00:06:50.487
But how extensive?

00:06:50.754 --> 00:06:53.524
&gt;&gt; It's a great question.

00:06:54.258 --> 00:06:56.226
Because what is so significant

00:06:56.493 --> 00:06:58.328
and dramatic about this is it

00:06:59.530 --> 00:07:00.197
is very visible.

00:07:00.464 --> 00:07:02.533
The Chinese have reconnaissance

00:07:04.334 --> 00:07:05.536
satellites that signal

00:07:05.936 --> 00:07:06.403
intelligence collectors and

00:07:06.670 --> 00:07:08.305
imagery intelligence collectors

00:07:09.540 --> 00:07:10.007
that are traversing over united

00:07:10.274 --> 00:07:12.209
States every day, collecting

00:07:12.476 --> 00:07:12.843
reams of intelligence.

00:07:13.544 --> 00:07:16.246
They have very aggressive

00:07:17.214 --> 00:07:18.482
intellectual property attacks

00:07:19.550 --> 00:07:20.250
on us.

00:07:20.517 --> 00:07:24.221
So, they are very aggressive

00:07:24.488 --> 00:07:25.556
about the us.

00:07:26.189 --> 00:07:29.560
Having settled at, this to me

00:07:29.560 --> 00:07:31.562
is sort of ham-handed to do

00:07:31.562 --> 00:07:33.564
this as an intelligence

00:07:33.931 --> 00:07:35.566
collection effort when they

00:07:35.699 --> 00:07:37.200
have so many other ways of

00:07:37.568 --> 00:07:40.337
gaining intelligence on the

00:07:41.572 --> 00:07:41.939
United States that is not

00:07:42.205 --> 00:07:44.408
nearly as visible and dramatic

00:07:44.675 --> 00:07:45.576
as this and this is what is

00:07:45.943 --> 00:07:48.278
drawn so much attention to

00:07:48.545 --> 00:07:48.645
this.

00:07:49.580 --> 00:07:50.347
We're concerned about our

00:07:51.582 --> 00:07:51.615
sovereignty.

00:07:51.882 --> 00:07:52.382
How high does sovereignty go?

00:07:52.649 --> 00:07:53.584
So, we will shoot down the

00:07:54.017 --> 00:07:55.586
balloon because it's an affront

00:07:55.786 --> 00:07:56.119
to our sovereignty.

00:07:56.386 --> 00:07:58.255
Well, the satellite I guess you

00:07:58.522 --> 00:08:00.324
could argue are an affront to

00:08:00.591 --> 00:08:01.224
our sovereignty as well and

00:08:01.592 --> 00:08:02.025
were not about shoot them down.

00:08:02.292 --> 00:08:05.796
&gt;&gt; That's right.

